# --- Next.js generated files ---
# next-env.d.ts points at .next/dev/types under `next dev` and at
# .next/types under `next build`, so committing it causes churn; the
# typecheck script regenerates it with `next typegen`.
next-env.d.ts
# Written by `next dev` for coding agents; not project documentation.
AGENTS.md

